 ### Hash Fusion with Occupancy Grid
-A method to handle hash collisions by estimating individual probabilities for colliding vertices and weighting them by their "Area of Effect" (AOE) [S8]. The final probability is a weighted sum: $p_i = \sum_{k=1}^K w_i^k \times p_i^k$, where $w_i^k = AOE_i^k / \sum_{j=1}^K AOE_i^j$ [S8].
